1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,726
The outside pressure arrived on a wet afternoon as an advisory letter from the attorney of a private owner, and the effect on the room was immediate.

2
00:00:08,726 --> 00:00:15,400
“You may not build a plant on land that is under a legal consideration,” the lawyer wrote.

3
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:27,718
“A vote is not a lawful title.” The judge had already signed the previous order, and the news reached city hall through a message from a concerned voter.

4
00:00:27,718 --> 00:00:32,927
The crime was not the fine itself but the implication behind it.

5
00:00:32,927 --> 00:00:41,915
“The offering of a deposit and a clean display of good reputation will not neutralize a charge of bribery,” the attorney said.

6
00:00:41,915 --> 00:00:51,033
“A volume of evidence is not the same as a lawful deed, and you cannot legalize an offence with an advertisement.”

7
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:55,377
“We are not here to grab the land,” Lin said.

8
00:00:55,377 --> 00:01:15,143
“We require the room to build what the neighborhood needs and nothing else.” The heir of the estate, a supporter of the resort plan, and an advisory board of two retired engineers all agreed that the attraction would bring a gross profit and a stable base of customers.

9
00:01:15,143 --> 00:01:19,738
The press conference that followed was a strange narration.

10
00:01:19,738 --> 00:01:25,761
“They condemn us for racism and surrender to a bull market,” a resident said.

11
00:01:25,761 --> 00:01:36,229
“The rebellion of a small neighborhood is not a pretence of rebellion; it is a refusal to confuse a shorts season with a water shortage.”

12
00:01:36,229 --> 00:01:48,007
The gay shopkeeper, the religious author, and the happy volunteer all had a point that the room was missing: the plant would embarrass the town and enable nothing.

13
00:01:48,007 --> 00:01:55,386
“The real victim of an illegal pump is a household that cannot appeal,” the author wrote.

14
00:01:55,386 --> 00:01:59,105
The advisory opinion changed the terms.

15
00:01:59,105 --> 00:02:09,078
The previous proposal was withdrawn, the deposit was returned, and the group was given thirty days to produce a lawful alternative.

16
00:02:09,078 --> 00:02:13,827
“A point is enough to start with,” the attorney said.

17
00:02:13,827 --> 00:02:27,802
The reality now was that the plant could not reside on that ground, and nobody could fix it with a win in the press; we would not enjoy the next month, but the law was the law.
